{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE LAKE LADY is a story-driven realistic horror interactive game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river took everything from him. To find his daughter who went missing in the flood, Salvio returns to his hometown as a doctor and infiltrates Hongqiang Hospital for investigation. A childhood friend who hesitates to speak, paranoid colleagues, the sinister threads of the ghost, continuously disappearing children, the off-limits 'Ward No. 9'\u2014what those around him desperately hide gradually unravels the hospital\u2019s true secrets.dy, forcing the horrifying truth behind a catastrophic flood five years prior to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/63e0eccb9533edea7285306f38f04d26.avif?t=1761028494\" data-has-big width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/cb6418f6c72eb9c685311c149bde6ad4.avif?t=1761028494\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with over ten distinct characters, each harboring their own secrets and motives \u2013 from a lost young girl and an obsessed mother, to a childhood friend with hidden depths, and powerful figures with ambiguous agendas. Every character is a vital piece of the puzzle. Understand them, question them... or even become them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/efffb727070daf6897c604bcdb9b2335.avif?t=1761028494\" data-has-big width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/b27a0739f2eecc67aeffa8b19df5a427.poster.avif?t=1761028494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/b27a0739f2eecc67aeffa8b19df5a427.webm?t=1761028494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/b27a0739f2eecc67aeffa8b19df5a427.mp4?t=1761028494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive choices and diverging paths interweave, preventing players from grasping the entire story at once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In certain branches, you may miss information from others, leading to reversals in relationships and plot twists. Make choices truest to your heart\u2014persuade characters, obtain key items, deduce the truth, and escape perilous situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/ceedbd35b699fa817798aeafbc64d96d.avif?t=1761028494\" data-has-big width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/e3d4a73a8fad12b08822eb2eae82bb88.poster.avif?t=1761028494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/e3d4a73a8fad12b08822eb2eae82bb88.webm?t=1761028494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/e3d4a73a8fad12b08822eb2eae82bb88.mp4?t=1761028494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse interactions aid in expressing and understanding the story. Includes a realistic surgery simulator, talisman exorcism based on the Five Elements theory, and side-scrolling exploration/escape\u2014moderate difficulty, easy to learn, fully immersive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foreshadowing narrative elements is embedded; no malicious puzzles designed to frustrate players exist.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/720586d68db866fcfd3e85f5915bb804.avif?t=1761028494\" data-has-big width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/c06fd17fa785eeafb04dde8dc036f068.poster.avif?t=1761028494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/c06fd17fa785eeafb04dde8dc036f068.webm?t=1761028494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/c06fd17fa785eeafb04dde8dc036f068.mp4?t=1761028494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game draws from traditional culture to fictionalize dark occult arts, presenting a bizarre and surreal experience. The atmosphere is grotesquely vibrant, with musical shifts heightening tension and quickening pulses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic millennial style, embodying the hazy, humid ambiance of southern China. Metal thermoses, public telephones, grid-patterned sofas\u2026 transport you back to the 1990s.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/15989ee626f7697084da974fcffea1e2.avif?t=1761028494\" data-has-big width=1560 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111010/extras/f631ee421d7d51d9677a49c16a5c2d05.avif?t=1761028494\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The supernatural is not illusion; thick realist hues make the experience more authentic, materializing the psychological shadows of a generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loss, search, ideals, family bonds, hope... This is a story about the lake lady, and also a story about substitutes.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rowing Oars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/8bed9507729a522ede6b0f8cd5b6b7d8ce204bf5.jpg"},{"name":"Nice to meet you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/6d99abd4e42181848dad9e9ae17d5f2c4588bfbb.jpg"},{"name":"Resident Physician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/47000467fb268d63d44055c22f8e95ce8483bf1b.jpg"},{"name":"Vibrant Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/9b3358dce737c1a308857adb92f1203b9f54a508.jpg"},{"name":"Childhood Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/44bf08eb598f680d1487184849b494f5d8fd31b4.jpg"},{"name":"Misery Loves Company","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/2fdc3e0427dbcdb2c42264ccfd73d5a5a6f0823f.jpg"},{"name":"Corpse Examiner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/0b6ea4561dafa6f43f9342827e486b05d265cdd4.jpg"},{"name":"Ward No. 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3111010/f3591338b5a3031cf73ffcad91a135157e1d660c.jpg"},{"name":"Spirit Returning Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam